{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_04_end",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_04",
  "title": "女将",
  "storyCode": "WR-4",
  "avgTag": "戦闘後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a09b69cd8ac9b941a9898c546f1dbeeda7d530a7d3229d68439e07434c2ab8bf",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うう、ううぅ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "お嬢ちゃん、ほら空が明るくなってきたよ。もうかなり歩いてきただろう？　もうすぐ着くから、泣かないでおくれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ううっ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "大丈夫、お兄ちゃんがついてるから、安全だよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "あぁ……いい子だから泣かないで。もう庭園は見えているよ。あと少しで到着するから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガアッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "いやあぁ――！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "ど、どうしてこんなところにいるんだ！　こいつらは太陽を怖がるはずじゃなかったのか！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "くそっ！　お嬢ちゃん、おぶってあげるから、しっかりつかまっていてくれ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガアッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "おじさん！　おじさん急いで！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "か、髪の毛を引っ張らないでくれ！　メガネが、メガネが落ちる！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガァッ！　グァッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……ウユウくん、逃げ足だけは本当に速いなぁ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "町民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "英雄さん、何かおっしゃいましたか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ん～？　何でもないよぉ。あなたたちは早く庭園に隠れてねぇ。外の警備は私に任せて〜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うーん……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あの小さな墨魎は、普通のオリジムシなんかよりもすばしっこいみたいだけど……どんどんウユウくんに離されてるねぇ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "まさか追いつけないほどウユウくんが速いのぉ？　そんなことってあるぅ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "ガッ……ガァ……ガァ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "くらえ！　えい！　はっ！　やぁっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "ははっ！　どうだ？　これで追いつけないだろう！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガッ！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "おじさん！　もっと速く走れないの！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "これ前からやってみたかったんだ。映画のカンフースターたちは、路地で追いかけられるときに、必ず何かを投げるからね！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "い、いいから！　もっと速く走って！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "痛っ！　頭を叩かないでくれよ、私は駄獣じゃないんだから！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガウッ――！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "回り込んできた！？　太陽があんなに眩しいのにどうしたんだ！　こいつらは光を恐れるんじゃなかったのか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "た、助けて！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "チッ！　仕方ない……お嬢ちゃん、先に逃げるんだ。私が――"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガッ！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "墨魎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_143#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ガ……ガ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "……クルース嬢！？　ああ～恩人様、助けられるんならもっと早く助けてくださいよ――って、どこにいるんです？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ここだよぉ～。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "わっ……！　お、お姉ちゃん、どこから出てきたの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "さすが非凡なる狙撃の名手、神出鬼没かつ軽やかな身のこなし、真に――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "お姉ちゃん！　おじさんを助けてくれてありがとう！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "うっ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "早くお家に戻ってねぇ、お母さんがずっと探してたよぉ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女の子",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩人様、早くラヴァ嬢とお坊様を助けに行った方がよろしいかと。ここは私が守りますのでご安心ください。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "あれぇ……？　さっきラヴァちゃんに、必ず助けに戻るって誓いを立ててなかったぁ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "お、恩人様はなんと恐ろしい地獄耳……ああいや、素晴らしい聴力をお持ちで……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別にそんなことないよぉ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ところでその扇子、どうしていつも手に握ってるのぉ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "や、これは必需品でして。私の一番のお気に入りです。恩師からの贈り物でもありますし、片時も手放したくないんですよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "それに……へへ、手に扇子を持っていれば、何となく文化人っぽいでしょう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ふうん……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "さっきの墨魎は、どうしてここまで来て平気だったのかなぁ？　ここはもうお昼だよねぇ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ウユウ",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "それはこっちが聞きたいです！　あいつに追いかけ回されて本当に疲れ果てましたよ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "クルース",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うーん……まぁ、まずはラヴァちゃんと合流しよぉ～。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "……静かになったな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "ここは夜の端で、明かりもわずかに見えるだけだっていうのに、どうして化け物が襲ってこないんだ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "それは拙僧も不思議に思っておった……今までこんなに静かだったことはないぞ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レイ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "静かなのは、良いことでしょう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "む！　いかにも。これで拙僧もようやく一息つけるでござる！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "よっこらしょっと。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レイ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "気をつけて。店の物を壊さないでね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "サガ、さっき言ってたシーウ……というのは？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "もちろん『夕娥（シーウ）、月に奔る』の美談に登場する夕娥のことだが？　ああ、拙僧は今でも彼女の両の瞳を忘れられぬ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ラヴァ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "……？？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レイ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "サガ、もっと順を追ってゆっくり話してあげたら？　ラヴァさんの顔がどんどん曇っていってるわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "お、すまぬすまぬ、つい興奮してしまった。さっきは墨魎と戦い、ラヴァ殿もくたびれたであろう？　ここで茶でも飲みながらゆっくり話さぬか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レイ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "じゃあ私はお茶を入れてきますね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "ああ、先に聞きたいことがあるのだが、レイ殿はここから出る方法を知っておるであろう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レイ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "いいえ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "サガ",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "知らぬのか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レイ",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（軽く首を横に振る）"
